# Verification: JH-40515

## Status
NEEDS_FIX

## Summary
Needs Changes. Static review confirms the grouped `人事設定` data map is mostly present and syntax checks pass, but the rendered select order does not match the reference UI: the leaf menu select is still before the master-setting group select in DOM order. I also found a secondary UI state issue for `所属 > 任意項目1/2/3`.

